Create a saved apply or destroy plan.

Usage:
  ainfra plan [DEPLOYMENT] [--destroy] [options]

Arguments:
  DEPLOYMENT         Deployment directory or ainfra.yaml path.

Options:
  --destroy          Create a destroy plan.
  -v, -vv, -vvv      Increase operational log verbosity.
  --log-level LEVEL  Set operational log level.
  --log-format text|json Set operational sink format.
  --log-file PATH    Add a rotating file sink.
  --syslog           Enable the local syslog sink.
  --format text|json Select output format.
  --output-style auto|rich|plain Select text presentation.
  --color auto|always|never Control terminal color.
  --help, -h         Show static help.
